OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1788240396
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACould a city get its new 'people's
OL,4,Apool'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group wants to open a new facility
OL,7,Fon the site of an old bowling green. It
OL,8,Fhas applied to Bristol City Council to
OL,9,Ftransfer stewardship of the site to the
OL,10,Fcommunity and is waiting for a decision
OL,11,Fin September.
OL,13,FBut while momentum is growing behind
OL,14,Fthe campaign, some residents say the
OL,15,Fplans could prove a "nightmare" for
OL,16,Fcongestion and environmental concerns.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
